# Text and interpolation

```rocci
<p>Hello, <strong>{name}</strong></p>
```

`{expr}` in text or attribute position is a Roc expression. Markup is not
allowed inside it.

| Case | Requirement |
| --- | --- |
| Text `{expr}` | Must be `Str` (`{count.to_str()}`) |
| Bare body param typed `Html` | Inserted as-is (`{content}`) |
| `@@` | Literal `@` in a template body |

**Errors:** `{if active { <Icon /> }}` is rejected. Use `@if` or a named
render function.

**Related:** [Directives](/docs/reference/language/directives/).
